### 3. Error Handling and Resources

Always ensure proper cleanup:

```csharp
// Safe P/Invoke pattern
try
{
    // Terminal operations
}
catch (Exception ex)
{
    // Log error
}
finally
{
    // Always restore terminal state
    DisableRawMode();
    ExitAlternateScreen();
    ShowCursor();
}
```

